<TITLE>Front Suspension Outline</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>225/45R17 tires adopted on Version S of 2AZ-FE engine models. Exclusive suspension tuning has been performed, achieving a high level of both excellent handling stability and ride comfort.</PTXT></ITEM>
<LIST2><ITEM><PTXT>The damping force characteristics of the shock absorbers, the spring rate characteristics of the coil springs, and the spring rate and damping characteristics of the upper supports have been optimized.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Vehicle height has been optimized by changing the installed load characteristics.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>EPS control characteristics have been optimized in accordance with the changes in tire and suspension characteristics.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST2></LIST1>
